cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use RuleMonkey in published work, please cite the original
  RuleMonkey paper (see preferred-citation below).
title: RuleMonkey
abstract: >-
  A network-free stochastic simulator for rule-based biochemical models
  written in BNGL. RuleMonkey reads a BioNetGen-generated XML model and
  runs an exact discrete-event simulation, producing observable
  trajectories in .gdat format. This is the RuleMonkey 3.x cleanroom
  C++17 rewrite, designed to be embedded as an in-process simulation
  kernel.
